    "steps": [
      "Put the split peas, onion and water in a pan and bring to a boil. Skim the foam.",
      "Simmer for 40 to 50 minutes, stirring now and then, until the peas collapse and the mixture is thick. Add a splash of hot water if it catches.",
      "Remove the onion, add 3 tablespoons of oil and blend until completely smooth. Season with salt and stir in the lemon juice.",
      "Let it rest for 10 minutes to thicken, then spoon onto a plate and top with the chopped red onion, capers and the remaining oil. Serve warm with bread."
